Bundled fonts (assets/)
-----------------------

The mod ships font files in `assets/` (deployed to `<mod>/assets/`) and embeds
one of them in the DLL as a last-resort fallback. These fonts are NOT covered
by this project's MIT license - they keep their own:

  * NotoSansCJKjp-Regular.ttf, NotoSansMonoCJKjp-Regular.ttf
    Noto Sans CJK JP / Noto Sans Mono CJK JP.
    Copyright (c) The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts).
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 - see
    https://openfontlicense.org. These are freely redistributable; the OFL
    text must accompany the font files when redistributed. (Converted from the
    upstream CFF/OTF to TrueType outlines with fontTools/cu2qu for stb_truetype
    compatibility; the outlines are re-quantized but the design is unchanged.)

  * Meiryo.ttf, yugothib.ttf (Yu Gothic Bold)
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Proprietary - NOT under an open
    license and NOT granted by this project. They are included here as
    legally-obtained copies for convenience; redistributing them is the
    responsibility of whoever ships this mod, subject to Microsoft's font
    licensing. Remove them from `assets/` (and `assets/deploy/`) if you are not
    entitled to redistribute Microsoft fonts - the mod falls back to the
    OFL-licensed Noto fonts automatically.

  * ITC Bolt/ITC Bolt.ttf  (+ ITC Bolt/License.txt)
    A TrueType build of ITC Bolt from OnlineWebFonts.Com, licensed under
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0) - see the bundled
    `ITC Bolt/License.txt`. Attribution required: credit OnlineWebFonts.Com
    ("Web Fonts"). Opt-in Latin display face (not an automatic fallback;
    Japanese/Cyrillic are supplied by the merged fallback font).
    The older "ITC Bolt Bold Regular.otf" (repo `assets/` only) is CFF/OTF,
    which stb_truetype cannot load - kept for reference, NOT deployed.
